<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amrion cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amrion cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>John G. Kinnard &amp; Co analyst Tom Emmel said he downgraded Amrion Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>The analyst was not immediately available for further comment. Amrion makes and markets nutriceuticals and nutritional supplements.</p>
<p>Shares in Amrion closed Tuesday in over-the-counter trading at 24-7/8.</p>
<p>On Monday, Whole Foods Market Inc said it had reached a definitive agreement to acquire Amrion for about $146 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
